 mode= 0 pure generator spreadoption evaluation, =1, incremental generator + \
BilogToHeston Optimization for the spreadoption evaluation\nint mode,\n\
\\t\\tdouble S1,double  S2,double  S3,double  S4,\n/// PCA decomposition\n\\t\
\\tdouble alpha11, double alpha12, double alpha13, double alpha14,\n\
